This package is an independent implementation of a Claude Code-inspired
interaction layer for DeepSeek Harness. It is not produced, endorsed, or
sponsored by Anthropic.

"Claude" and "Claude Code" are trademarks of Anthropic, PBC. They are used here
only in a descriptive sense to name the interaction style the plugin emulates.

The palette, status-star frames, verb pool, completion words, icons, and
interaction code are this project's own implementation. No third-party source
code, bytecode, artwork, logo, font, or screenshot is contained in this package.

The status glyph is the standard Unicode character U+273B (TEARDROP-SPOKED
ASTERISK), rendered as text. No Anthropic logo or icon asset is included.

The plugin is built exclusively from DeepSeek Harness public extension points
(Cordis slots and services). It does not embed, patch, or redistribute files
from the Harness or from any other plugin.

Third-party runtime dependencies: none beyond the host-provided React runtime.

